[2026-03-16T03:56:18.215Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CYGGPhXBEfozbwVpf8WeKw","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now let me create a comprehensive summary of all the files I found.\n\n## Summary of React Components for Home/Search Page\n\nI've found all the React component files related to the Home/Search page in the Airbnb Clone app. Here's the complete list:\n\n### Main Page Component:\n**1. /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/Home.tsx**\n- The main Home/Search page component that orchestrates the entire search experience\n- Manages global state for properties, filters, and favorites using Redux\n- Handles search submissions, category selection, filter application, pagination, and favorites fetching\n- Renders the SearchBar, CategoryFilter, FiltersPanel, PropertyGrid, and Pagination components\n\n### Search & Filter Components:\n\n**2. /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/SearchBar.tsx**\n- Search form component with fields for location (city), check-in date, check-out date, and number of guests\n- Validates dates (check-out must be after check-in)\n- Uses lucide-react Search icon\n- Includes comprehensive accessibility attributes (ARIA labels, semantic HTML)\n\n**3. /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/CategoryFilter.tsx**\n- Horizontal scrollable category filter showing property types: Apartment, House, Cabin, Villa, Condo, Loft, Cottage, Townhouse\n- Custom SVG icons for each property type\n- Includes scroll left/right navigation buttons when content overflows\n- Toggle functionality to select/deselect property types\n- Fully accessible with keyboard and screen reader support\n\n**4. /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/FiltersPanel.tsx**\n- Advanced filtering panel with price range, rooms/beds/bathrooms selection, and amenities\n- Modal dialog that opens with a toggle button\n- Features include:\n  - Min/Max price inputs\n  - Bedrooms, beds, and bathrooms dropdowns (0-8+ options)\n  - Dynamic amenity checkboxes grouped by category (fetched from Redux)\n  - Apply and Clear all buttons\n  - Keyboard support (Escape to close)\n\n### Property Grid & Cards:\n\n**5. /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyGrid.tsx**\n- Grid container for displaying properties in a responsive layout (1-4 columns based on screen size)\n- Shows loading spinner while fetching properties\n- Displays \"No properties found\" message when search returns no results\n- Uses semantic HTML with aria-label for accessibility\n\n**6. /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyCard.tsx**\n- Individual property listing card showing:\n  - Main image with hover zoom effect\n  - Location (city, country)\n  - Property title\n  - Number of beds and bedrooms\n  - Price per night\n  - Star rating (if reviewed) or \"New\" badge\n  - FavoriteButton overlay\n- Links to property detail page\n- Full keyboard and screen reader accessibility\n\n**7. /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/FavoriteButton.tsx**\n- Heart icon button to add/remove properties from favorites\n- Only visible when user is logged in\n- Prevents event propagation to avoid triggering property link navigation\n- Uses Redux to manage favorite state\n- Filled/outlined heart based on favorite status\n\n### Pagination:\n\n**8. /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/Pagination.tsx**\n- Navigation component for multi-page results\n- Shows previous/next buttons and page numbers\n- Smart pagination display (ellipsis for large page ranges)\n- Scrolls page to top when navigating between pages\n- Fully accessible with aria-labels and aria-current attributes\n\n### Styling:\n\n**9. /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/index.css**\n- Global CSS with Tailwind CSS imports and custom theme variables\n- Defines Airbnb-inspired color palette (primary red #FF385C, neutral grays)\n- Styles for app layout, header bar, footer\n- Responsive design with mobile breakpoints (@media max-width: 768px)\n- Uses CSS variables for consistent theming throughout the app\n\nAll components are built with TypeScript, use React hooks (useState, useEffect, useCallback, useRef), integrate with Redux for state management, and include comprehensive accessibility features (ARIA labels, semantic HTML, keyboard navigation)."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a0a681f925abc4c53 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 38007\ntool_uses: 13\nduration_ms: 21107</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"86161195-4169-4a92-bdd7-a3ad98ce3da2","uuid":"518b23a4-2796-45b1-98e5-4f3319206fc4","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In /repo/apps/AirbnbClone, find all React component files related to the Home / Search page. This is an Airbnb clone app. Look for:\n1. The main Home or Search page component\n2. Any related sub-components (search bar, property cards/listings grid, filters, etc.)\n3. The index.css file if it exists\n\nList the full paths and give a brief summary of what each file contains. Read the content of each file found.","agentId":"a0a681f925abc4c53","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now let me create a comprehensive summary of all the files I found.\n\n## Summary of React Components for Home/Search Page\n\nI've found all the React component files related to the Home/Search page in the Airbnb Clone app. Here's the complete list:\n\n### Main Page Component:\n**1. /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/Home.tsx**\n- The main Home/Search page component that orchestrates the entire search experience\n- Manages global state for properties, filters, and favorites using Redux\n- Handles search submissions, category selection, filter application, pagination, and favorites fetching\n- Renders the SearchBar, CategoryFilter, FiltersPanel, PropertyGrid, and Pagination components\n\n### Search & Filter Components:\n\n**2. /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/SearchBar.tsx**\n- Search form component with fields for location (city), check-in date, check-out date, and number of guest